      "style": "MatterHeading",
      "text": "ABOUT WEALTH PATH AI GLOBAL",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0034",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0034"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Wealth Path AI Global (WPAG) is the institutional platform for research, documentation, governance, and further development of HFOS. Its remit is educational and research-focused.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0036",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0036"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Its core objective is to contribute to understanding financial stability, growth, and risk through system-based thinking.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0038",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0038"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "HFOS — the Human Financial Operating System — is a conceptual educational framework. Srinivas Goud is its conceptual developer and creator; WPAG is its institutional platform. It supports discussion of financial structures, without validated assessment or individualized guidance.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0040",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0040"
      ],
      "style": "MatterHeading",
      "text": "ABOUT HFOS",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0042",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0042"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The Human Financial Operating System (HFOS) is a conceptual framework for considering financial stability through three primary variables: Load, Flow, and Capacity.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0044",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0044"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Its focus is the relationship between these variables over time. Budgeting, tracking, and other financial information can inform that discussion; the framework does not establish that such information is unimportant.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0046",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0046"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "HFOS is presented here as a Structural Financial Operating System: an educational framework for describing and organizing financial conditions through system-based principles. This manuscript does not supply a validated assessment method.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0048",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0048"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "HFOS is organized into seven phases:",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0050",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0050"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Phase 1 — Stability",
      "links": []
