    {
      "id": "src_D0061",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0061"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "This document is structured as a system, not as a traditional book.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0063",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0063"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Each chapter builds upon the previous one. The sequence must be followed to fully understand the system.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0065",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0065"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The objective is not to provide immediate answers, but to establish a structural understanding of stability.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "id": "src_D0067",
      "anchors": [
        "src_D0067"
      ],
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Readers are encouraged to focus on the relationships between concepts rather than isolated statements.",
